<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>纽约时报 &amp;gt; 美国 &amp;gt; 政治</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/on-politics</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:13:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>特朗普返回道尔顿在佐治亚州执行救援任务</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/16/us/politics/trump-rally-dalton-georgia.html</link><description>此外，凯蒂·扎卡里亚 (Katie Zacharia) 下台、AOC 竞选活动以及缅因州另一场紧张的辩论。</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:13:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/16/us/politics/trump-rally-dalton-georgia.html</guid></item><item><title>州立法机关选举和党派控制面临风险的指南</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/15/us/politics/state-local-elections-midterms.html</link><description>立法机关待争夺的州指南。</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:06:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/15/us/politics/state-local-elections-midterms.html</guid></item><item><title>通胀数据显示物价上涨，令中期选举前的共和党人感到担忧</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/14/us/politics/inflation-republicans-midterms-trump.html</link><description>最新的通胀报告让民主党有机会将油价的痛苦与特朗普总统的决定联系起来。</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:28:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/14/us/politics/inflation-republicans-midterms-trump.html</guid></item><item><title>埃隆·马斯克的钱如何塑造共和党的中期战略</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/13/us/politics/elon-musk-republicans-spending.html</link><description>2.5亿美元帮助共和党控制国会。</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:43:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/13/us/politics/elon-musk-republicans-spending.html</guid></item><item><title>在深红色的堪萨斯州，一场竞争异常激烈的参议院竞选正在形成</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/09/us/politics/kansas-senate-race-2026-marshall-hamilton.html</link><description>亚当·汉密尔顿希望成为近 100 年来第一位赢得参议院席位的民主党人。</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 23:01:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/09/us/politics/kansas-senate-race-2026-marshall-hamilton.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普如何疏远共和党选民</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/08/us/politics/trump-republican-voters.html</link><description>另外，参议院战场上还有一场大型辩论之夜。</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 23:24:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/08/us/politics/trump-republican-voters.html</guid></item><item><title>肯·帕克斯顿在德克萨斯州参议员竞选中向谁寻求帮助？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/07/us/politics/ken-paxton-texas-senate-race.html</link><description>特朗普今晚将在德克萨斯州为参议院候选人进行竞选活动。</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 22:56:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/07/us/politics/ken-paxton-texas-senate-race.html</guid></item><item><title>由于这些选民群体，民主党在民意调查中看起来很强大</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/06/us/politics/democrats-senate-polls-voters.html</link><description>不同的集团正在左移。他们可以左右关键的参议院竞选。</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 22:39:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/06/us/politics/democrats-senate-polls-voters.html</guid></item><item><title>对共和党感到不满的拉美裔选民可能会决定中期选举</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/02/us/politics/midterms-hispanic-voters-trump.html</link><description>拉美裔选民对共和党越来越不满。原因如下。</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 21:38:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/02/us/politics/midterms-hispanic-voters-trump.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普在跨越共和党据点的中期巡演中进行辩护</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/30/us/politics/trump-midterms-oklahoma-alabama-nebraska.html</link><description>一些深红色区域需要震动。</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:54:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/30/us/politics/trump-midterms-oklahoma-alabama-nebraska.html</guid></item></channel></rss>